WEBVTT

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I'll try to throw in the middle of your breath.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Come on.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:42.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay, stop, stop. Oh, good.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:44.000
Carmen Cruickshank: What the frick? Why do I care? Why do you care? Got our events.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And…

